OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 1 FEB
OL,4,G1800FPick of the Pops
OL,5,     GMark Goodier counts down the
OL,6,     Gchart from this day in 1993.
OL,7,G1900FTony Blackburn's Golden Hour
OL,8,     GTony Blackburn spins his personal
OL,9,     Gpick of the hits from across the
OL,10,     Gdecades. To listen on most smart
OL,11,     Gspeakers just 'ask BBC Sounds to
OL,12,     Gplay Tony Blackburn's Golden
OL,13,     GHour'.
OL,14,G2000FThe Paul Gambaccini Collection
OL,15,     GGambo has Grammy Record of the
OL,16,     GYear Winners & Brits Who Topped
OL,17,     GThe US Charts. Also, his Ivor
OL,18,     GNovello winner is Michael Ball.
OL,19,     GAnd a live track from Neil Young.
